+# Root prospective41 finite-carrier link algebra boundary
+
+About21:24UTC, before proof/check. The compact-to-qubit bridge32–35 preserves exact gauge covariance under full-irrep Peter–Weyl cutoffs, but projected holonomies need not be unitary. Investigate an exact obstruction and a priced low-energy repair rather than silently transferring38's full-unitary path upper trial to finite hardware.
+
+Candidate finite-H obstruction: a unitary3by3 operator matrix U transforming as a fundamental under an independently exact SU3 endpoint action would intertwine rho tensor I3 with rho tensor bar3. Finite-character equality gives3chi_rho=chi_rho chi_bar3 nearidentity, impossible. Need specify stronglycontinuous exactgaugeaction/finite nonzeroHilbert/noapproximatecovariance, notallqubitgaugeencodings.
+
+Actual P_R cutoffcandidate: compressed transporter mathcalU_R=P_R mathcalU P_R is a contraction, with unitarity defect D=I-mathcalU_R†mathcalU_R supported on boundary shell p+q=R and norm exactly1 for everyR. Highestweight psi=(U11)^R and sourcecolor e1 should be annihilated by all retained U_i1 multiplications, since each lies in(R+1,0). Prove pure symmetric representation, notjusttriality. Interiorp+q<=R-1 hasexactone-stepunitarity. Energy shellthreshold g_(R-1) controls defectexpectation<=E/g. Potential pathstateerrorbound <=sqrt(L E/g) on initiallyretainedsimpleLlinkstates from telescoping/Cauchy–Schwarz; keepstate-specific notoperatornormconvergence. Checkmatrixorientation/colorcovariance carefully.
+
+Generalfiniteobstructionlikelyknownquantumlinkprinciple; seek primaryliterature and credit, noTOEuniversalnegative. Scope doesnotforbidapproximateunitarity, continuousgaugefinitequantumlinks, exactdiscretegaugegroups or lowenergyconvergence.
diff --git a/.claude/science/physics-loops/finite-transporter-bridge-20260907/evidence/root/ROOT_DERIVATION.md b/.claude/science/physics-loops/finite-transporter-bridge-20260907/evidence/root/ROOT_DERIVATION.md
